  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Chipped</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BAscRYKm/images/cbbeeca232f2632aef4ac4856f80c2e7566a4461.png\" alt=\"Chipped\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/I80VLV.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 制作\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fresourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/jUWHY2.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/TNilje.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Athena\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>你是否曾想过用巨型砂岩砖建造一座史诗般的城堡？或者用纯净的镁块搭建一座下界要塞？也许你只是想用泥土盖个房子，或是用臭名昭著的闪长岩脸制作图腾柱？无论如何，我们都能满足你的需求！</p>\n<p>Chipped 是一款适用于 1.16+ 版本的建筑模组，极大地丰富了你在游戏中可用的方块种类。本模组提供超过 11,000 种独特的建筑方块，从染色玻璃变体一直涵盖到混凝土、海晶石甚至镶金黑石！不仅所有纹理均采用原版风格手工绘制，还包含大量连接纹理，由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athena</a> 驱动！</p>\n<p>灵感源自广受欢迎的 Chisel 模组，Chipped 赋予建造者无限的创作空间，因为每一个方块都值得拥有伙伴！</p>\n<p>入门非常简单，只需制作七种工作台中的任意一种即可将各种原版方块转换为对应的碎化变体。这些工作台外观各异但功能相同，你可以挑选最符合建筑风格的一款，或者制作多个并分散摆放在家中。无论你想实现什么创意，Chipped 都能助你将其变为现实！</p>\n<br>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r9FApKUUDnE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h4>程序开发：</h4>\nGrim, Alex Nijjar, MsRandom1, CodexAdrian, ThatGravyBoat\n<h4>美术设计：</h4>\nKekie6, Marc-IceBlade, Shrimp, Facu, Frogipher, SunsetSoup, Valilla, Brother Earth, Joosh, ArtistMonster, Zilver</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"与好友同乐的最佳方式。体验 Essential Mod\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">✨社交媒体✨<br><br></h3>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>\n<h3>查看我们的其他项目<br><br></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/9DjUsr.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"手工打造\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/lRunun.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Chipped\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/snZW6z.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Ad Astra\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252ftempad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/HPp8Fo.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Tempad\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fspirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/SQ4Me7.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Spirit\" width=\"96\"></a>